      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a draft response for the hotel to post:\n\n\"Thank you for taking the time to share your feedback about your breakfast experience at @VeritasBoutique. We apologize that the buffet was not adequately stocked, and our staff didn't meet your expectations in fulfilling your request for more eggs. We'll pass along your concerns to our team and take steps to ensure our breakfast offerings and service are up to our usual high standards. We value your loyalty and would like to make it right - please contact us directly so we can discuss a resolution.\"\n\nThis response acknowledges the guest's disappointment, expresses regret, and commits to addressing the issue, while maintaining a grounded and sincere tone.",
